<title>HONG KONG: Kingmaker interim net down 8.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Kingmaker interim net down 8.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.7    vs  7.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    28.77  vs  31.38</p>
<p>    Turnover		     391.94 vs  260.54</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kingmaker Footwear Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 27-31, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 15, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Kingmaker Footwear Holdings is a sports shoe maker.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to March 31 from December 31. Comparative figures are for six months to June 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
